{"words": [{"text": "وَلَقَدْ", "translation": "And indeed"}, {"text": "عَلِمْتُمُ", "translation": "you knew"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ٱعْتَدَوْا۟", "translation": "transgressed"}, {"text": "مِنكُمْ", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّبْتِ", "translation": "the (matter of) Sabbath"}, {"text": "فَقُلْنَا", "translation": "So We said"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "كُونُوا۟", "translation": "Be"}, {"text": "قِرَدَةً", "translation": "apes"}, {"text": "خَـٰسِـِٔينَ", "translation": "despised"}], "sahih": "And you had already known about those who transgressed among you concerning the sabbath, and We said to them, \"Be apes, despised.\""}